Subject: Integrate Nix-managed resources, updates and TUN capabilities

Use the independently packaged Electron runtime, native sysproxy binding
and three Mihomo cores. Preserve the production data directory and wrapper
path when starting through Electron. Use NixOS-managed capabilities only
on the core executables and keep ordinary proxy mode available to other
users. Nix owns application and core updates instead of the GUI installer.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Nix-specific resource and privilege management]

